### Case: key-registered — an operator stores a partner's armored public key.
### Expect 200. The value comes from the request BODY, which is what keeps key
### material out of the configuration document.
### ADMINISTRATIVE ROUTE: as shipped it is unauthenticated, which is a deliberate
### property of every package in this library and not a recommendation.
POST {{GATEWAY}}/partners/keys
X-Partner-Id: {{PARTNER_ID}}
content-type: application/json

{"public_key": "-----BEGIN PGP PUBLIC KEY BLOCK-----\n...\n-----END PGP PUBLIC KEY BLOCK-----\n"}
